  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat",
    "Add chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for an additional minute",
    "Add fry grind rice and khao khuat, stir to combine, and cook for 2 minutes",
    "Add uncooked white rice, stir to combine, and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add diced smoked salmon, stir to combine, and cook until heated through",
    "Stir in grated parmesan cheese until melted and well combined",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste",
    "Transfer pilaf to a serving dish and garnish with chopped fresh parsley"
